Package: croc
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ca-certificates
Description: transfer files and directories using a shared code
 croc transfers files and directories between computers using encrypted
 connections and a short shared code. A relay can connect peers behind NAT.
 The package installs the command-line program and shell completions.
